title UC.27 - Threat Mitigation (Cypher Guard AST & Emergency Kill Switch)

actor "User / IT Admin" as Actor
boundary "Web Dashboard / UI" as UI
control "CopilotEngine &\nTextToCypher" as Copilot
control "CypherGuard\n(AST Interceptor)" as Guard
control "WorkstationRouter\n& WSS Manager" as WSS
control "AEGIS_Agent\n(Windows Host)" as Agent
database "PostgreSQL &\nNeo4j" as DB

== Part 1: Read-Only Cypher Guard & Mutation Interceptor (FR61) ==
Actor -> UI : 1. Submit natural language query to Hybrid AI Copilot
UI -> Copilot : 2. POST /api/v1/copilot/query
Copilot -> Copilot : 3. Generate candidate Cypher query via LLM
Copilot -> Guard : 4. validate_read_only_cypher(cypher_query)
Guard -> Guard : 5. Parse AST tokens & scan for forbidden keywords\n(CREATE, MERGE, DELETE, DETACH, SET, REMOVE, DROP, CALL dbms)

alt [E1: Forbidden Mutation Keyword Detected]
    Guard -> DB : 6a. INSERT INTO audit_logs (severity='CRITICAL', event='BLOCKED_CYPHER_MUTATION')
    Guard --> Copilot : 7a. Raise UnsafeCypherQueryException
    Copilot -> Copilot : 8a. Fallback to safe Qdrant Vector RAG search
    Copilot --> UI : 9a. Return read-only safety refusal warning + safe vector response
else [Safe Read-Only Cypher (MATCH ... RETURN)]
    Guard --> Copilot : 6b. Validation PASSED
    Copilot -> DB : 7b. Execute read-only Cypher on Neo4j Driver
    DB --> Copilot : 8b. Return graph nodes & relationships
    Copilot --> UI : 9b. 200 OK (Answer + Graph & Source Citations)
end

== Part 2: AEGIS Workstation Emergency Kill Switch (<= 3s) (FR62) ==
Actor -> UI : 10. Click Emergency Kill Switch on Workstation WS01 & confirm password
UI -> WSS : 11. POST /api/v1/workstations/WS01/kill-switch (admin_password)
WSS -> DB : 12. Verify IT Admin password hash
WSS -> Agent : 13. WSS push: {"action": "EMERGENCY_KILL", "priority": "IMMEDIATE"}
Agent -> Agent : 14. Close file watcher streams, terminate worker threads & exit (<= 3s)
Agent --> WSS : 15. WSS ACK: {"status": "TERMINATING"}
WSS -> DB : 16. UPDATE workstations SET status='TERMINATED';\nINSERT INTO audit_logs (severity='CRITICAL', event='KILL_SWITCH_EXECUTED')
WSS --> UI : 17. 200 OK (Workstation WS01 isolated in 1.8s)
@enduml